<overview>
<p>The Taurian Defense Force assigns conventional infantry to garrison and planetary defense roles across the Concordat, where citizen-soldiers serve out of patriotic duty rather than mere obligation. Motorized platoons provide faster response than foot infantry without the cost of full mechanized transport, riding light vehicles or motorcycles that can cover ground quickly on the road networks connecting Taurian population centers. Their speed makes them well-suited to the wide-area patrol duties that Concordat garrison doctrine demands.</p><p>Armed with standard ballistic assault rifles, the most common and affordable infantry weapon in the Inner Sphere, these platoons deliver reliable short-range firepower and can be equipped and resupplied from almost any garrison stockpile.</p>
</overview>

